    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashikisha Yelemiya kuambila bantu aba mei onso a Yehowa Nzambi wabo, mei â onso mene akamutuma Yehowa Nzambi wabo nʼau bua kubambila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azâya, muana wa Hoshaya, Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, ne bena dihetu bonso bakambila Yelemiya ne, Wewe udi wamba mei a mashimi. Yehowa Nzambi wetu kakukutuma bua kutuambila ne, Kanuyi ku Ejipitu bua kushikamaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi Baluka, muana wa Neliya, udi ukukabila kutudi, bua kutufila mu bianza bia Bena Kasada, bua batushihe ne bua baye nʼetu mu buhika ku Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, ne tupitene tuonso tua bena nvita ne bantu bonso kabakatumikila dî dia Yehowa ne, Bashikame mu buloba bua Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, ne tupitene tuonso tua nvita bakangata bonso ba mu Yuda bakadi bashala, bobo mene bakadi bahingane ku Yuda bua kushikamaku, bafume ku makelenge onso kuakadibo babatume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakadi balume, bakashi ne bana, bana bakashi ba mukelenge ne muntu yonso wakadi Nebuzaladana, kapitene ka bansentedi ba masalayi, mushiye mu bianza bia Gedaliya, muana wa Ahikama, muana wa Shefana; Yelemiya muprofete kabidi ne Baluka, muana wa Neliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalua mu buloba bua Ejipitu; bualu bua kabakatumikila dî dia Yehowa; bakafika ku Tapanehese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya mu Tapanehese ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angata mabue manene mu bianza biebe, wateke mu tshimama tshia matafuadi a mu tshiendelu tshidi ku tshibuelelu tshia ku nsubu wa Palô udi mu Tapanehese. Enza nunku ku mesu kua Bena Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ubambile ne, Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Tangilai, nentume dî bua kubikila Nebukadenesâ, mukelenge wa Babulona, muntu wanyi; ne yeye neajadike nkuasa wandi wa bukelenge ha mutu ha mabue â anakusokoka, yeye neashimike tshitanda tshiandi tshia bukelenge ha mutu hau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye nealue, neakume ba mu buloba bua Ejipitu, ufila ku lufu bandi nsunguila lufu, ubuesha mu buhika bandi nsunguila buhika, ufila ku muele wa nvita bandi nsunguila muele wa nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nentemeshe kahia mu nsubu ya nzambi ya mu Ejipitu, Nebukadenesâ neoshe nsubu ne neaye ne nzambi ei mu buhika. Nealengeshe buloba bua Ejipitu bu mudi mulami wa mikoko umusha tuishi ku tshmialu tshiandi, nealuhukemu ne ditalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neashimbule bibumba bia ku Bete-shemeshe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43.13:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dina dikuabo,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Helio-polis",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ", kukudimuna mu muaku ne,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Musoko wa diba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mu buloba bua Ejipitu kabidi; neoshe nsubu ya nzambi ya mu Ejipitu ne kahia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
